/// The tenant-owned instance's backstop for a routed rpc, run after request
/// validation and before the handler: the route field must be a tid
/// (INVALID_ARGUMENT), and on a tenant-owned instance it must be the tid of
/// the instance's own subject (PERMISSION_DENIED), never the tenant its
/// namespace claim names (kernel#23). A tenant-owned instance whose subject
/// names no tid serves no routed call; a shared instance checks the shape
